{
 "long": [
  {
   "words": "Disney asked a dying AI firm to go bust first.",
   "point": "",
   "picture": {
    "kind": "",
    "what": "",
    "source": "",
    "source_label": ""
   },
   "on_screen_text": "",
   "modules": [],
   "motion": "",
   "timing": "from the take (narration_diff.py)"
  },
  {
   "words": "That way it could hire the team and leave the lawsuits behind.",
   "point": "",
   "picture": {
    "kind": "",
    "what": "",
    "source": "",
    "source_label": ""
   },
   "on_screen_text": "",
   "modules": [],
   "motion": "",
   "timing": "from the take (narration_diff.py)"
  },
  {
   "words": "So why are Disney and Google both paying for pieces of the same company?",
   "point": "",
   "picture": {
    "kind": "",
    "what": "",
    "source": "",
    "source_label": ""
   },
   "on_screen_text": "",
   "modules": [],
   "motion": "",
   "timing": "from the take (narration_diff.py)"
  },
  {
   "words": "And what does it mean for you?",
   "point": "",
   "picture": {
    "kind": "",
    "what": "",
    "source": "",
    "source_label": ""
   },
   "on_screen_text": "",
   "modules": [],
   "motion": "",
   "timing": "from the take (narration_diff.py)"
  },
  {
   "words": "I've been reading the court papers on Character.AI, the app where millions of people chat with made-up characters.",
   "point": "",
   "picture": {
    "kind": "",
    "what": "",
    "source": "",
    "source_label": ""
   },
   "on_screen_text": "",
   "modules": [],
   "motion": "",
   "timing": "from the take (narration_diff.py)"
  },
  {
   "words": "Two giants have now paid for pieces of it, for very different reasons.",
   "point": "",
   "picture": {
    "kind": "",
    "what": "",
    "source": "",
    "source_label": ""
   },
   "on_screen_text": "",
   "modules": [],
   "motion": "",
   "timing": "from the take (narration_diff.py)"
  },
  {
   "words": "So I wanted to break it down for you.",
   "point": "",
   "picture": {
    "kind": "",
    "what": "",
    "source": "",
    "source_label": ""
   },
   "on_screen_text": "",
   "modules": [],
   "motion": "",
   "timing": "from the take (narration_diff.py)"
  },
  {
   "words": "Let's start with Google.",
   "point": "",
   "picture": {
    "kind": "",
    "what": "",
    "source": "",
    "source_label": ""
   },
   "on_screen_text": "",
   "modules": [],
   "motion": "",
   "timing": "from the take (narration_diff.py)"
  },
  {
   "words": "Google wanted the brains behind the app.",
   "point": "",
   "picture": {
    "kind": "",
    "what": "",
    "source": "",
    "source_label": ""
   },
   "on_screen_text": "",
   "modules": [],
   "motion": "",
   "timing": "from the take (narration_diff.py)"
  },
  {
   "words": "So in 2024, it reportedly paid two point seven billion dollars to use Character.AI's tech.",
   "point": "",
   "picture": {
    "kind": "",
    "what": "",
    "source": "",
    "source_label": ""
   },
   "on_screen_text": "",
   "modules": [],
   "motion": "",
   "timing": "from the take (narration_diff.py)"
  },
  {
   "words": "And it hired the founders and their research team away.",
   "point": "",
   "picture": {
    "kind": "",
    "what": "",
    "source": "",
    "source_label": ""
   },
   "on_screen_text": "",
   "modules": [],
   "motion": "",
   "timing": "from the take (narration_diff.py)"
  },
  {
   "words": "Google was racing to build the smartest AI, and these people were very good at it.",
   "point": "",
   "picture": {
    "kind": "",
    "what": "",
    "source": "",
    "source_label": ""
   },
   "on_screen_text": "",
   "modules": [],
   "motion": "",
   "timing": "from the take (narration_diff.py)"
  },
  {
   "words": "But the rest of the staff stayed behind, and the app carried on, until its cash started running low.",
   "point": "",
   "picture": {
    "kind": "",
    "what": "",
    "source": "",
    "source_label": ""
   },
   "on_screen_text": "",
   "modules": [],
   "motion": "",
   "timing": "from the take (narration_diff.py)"
  },
  {
   "words": "Now, Disney wanted something else, and to see why, go back to last December.",
   "point": "",
   "picture": {
    "kind": "",
    "what": "",
    "source": "",
    "source_label": ""
   },
   "on_screen_text": "",
   "modules": [],
   "motion": "",
   "timing": "from the take (narration_diff.py)"
  },
  {
   "words": "Disney agreed to put a billion dollars into OpenAI.",
   "point": "",
   "picture": {
    "kind": "",
    "what": "",
    "source": "",
    "source_label": ""
   },
   "on_screen_text": "",
   "modules": [],
   "motion": "",
   "timing": "from the take (narration_diff.py)"
  },
  {
   "words": "As part of that deal, over two hundred Disney characters would star in Sora, OpenAI's video app.",
   "point": "",
   "picture": {
    "kind": "",
    "what": "",
    "source": "",
    "source_label": ""
   },
   "on_screen_text": "",
   "modules": [],
   "motion": "",
   "timing": "from the take (narration_diff.py)"
  },
  {
   "words": "But Sora belonged to OpenAI.",
   "point": "",
   "picture": {
    "kind": "",
    "what": "",
    "source": "",
    "source_label": ""
   },
   "on_screen_text": "",
   "modules": [],
   "motion": "",
   "timing": "from the take (narration_diff.py)"
  },
  {
   "words": "So Disney was really renting space for Mickey, Marvel and Star Wars on someone else's app.",
   "point": "",
   "picture": {
    "kind": "",
    "what": "",
    "source": "",
    "source_label": ""
   },
   "on_screen_text": "",
   "modules": [],
   "motion": "",
   "timing": "from the take (narration_diff.py)"
  },
  {
   "words": "Then in March, OpenAI shut Sora down.",
   "point": "",
   "picture": {
    "kind": "",
    "what": "",
    "source": "",
    "source_label": ""
   },
   "on_screen_text": "",
   "modules": [],
   "motion": "",
   "timing": "from the take (narration_diff.py)"
  },
  {
   "words": "The deal died, and no money changed hands.",
   "point": "",
   "picture": {
    "kind": "",
    "what": "",
    "source": "",
    "source_label": ""
   },
   "on_screen_text": "",
   "modules": [],
   "motion": "",
   "timing": "from the take (narration_diff.py)"
  },
  {
   "words": "Disney said it respected the decision, which is a very polite way to say, well, that's awkward.",
   "point": "",
   "picture": {
    "kind": "",
    "what": "",
    "source": "",
    "source_label": ""
   },
   "on_screen_text": "",
   "modules": [],
   "motion": "",
   "timing": "from the take (narration_diff.py)"
  },
  {
   "words": "So Disney changed its plan.",
   "point": "",
   "picture": {
    "kind": "",
    "what": "",
    "source": "",
    "source_label": ""
   },
   "on_screen_text": "",
   "modules": [],
   "motion": "",
   "timing": "from the take (narration_diff.py)"
  },
  {
   "words": "In September, it hired Character.AI's chief executive, who ran the firm after the founders left.",
   "point": "",
   "picture": {
    "kind": "",
    "what": "",
    "source": "",
    "source_label": ""
   },
   "on_screen_text": "",
   "modules": [],
   "motion": "",
   "timing": "from the take (narration_diff.py)"
  },
  {
   "words": "He got a brand new job, Disney's first ever technology chief.",
   "point": "",
   "picture": {
    "kind": "",
    "what": "",
    "source": "",
    "source_label": ""
   },
   "on_screen_text": "",
   "modules": [],
   "motion": "",
   "timing": "from the take (narration_diff.py)"
  },
  {
   "words": "And this month, the court papers show the rest of the plan.",
   "point": "",
   "picture": {
    "kind": "",
    "what": "",
    "source": "",
    "source_label": ""
   },
   "on_screen_text": "",
   "modules": [],
   "motion": "",
   "timing": "from the take (narration_diff.py)"
  },
  {
   "words": "Disney has offered jobs to sixty-six of Character.AI's staff.",
   "point": "",
   "picture": {
    "kind": "",
    "what": "",
    "source": "",
    "source_label": ""
   },
   "on_screen_text": "",
   "modules": [],
   "motion": "",
   "timing": "from the take (narration_diff.py)"
  },
  {
   "words": "All together, their pay comes to about sixty million dollars a year, for three years.",
   "point": "",
   "picture": {
    "kind": "",
    "what": "",
    "source": "",
    "source_label": ""
   },
   "on_screen_text": "",
   "modules": [],
   "motion": "",
   "timing": "from the take (narration_diff.py)"
  },
  {
   "words": "On top of that, Disney has bid twenty million dollars for the code.",
   "point": "",
   "picture": {
    "kind": "",
    "what": "",
    "source": "",
    "source_label": ""
   },
   "on_screen_text": "",
   "modules": [],
   "motion": "",
   "timing": "from the take (narration_diff.py)"
  },
  {
   "words": "That includes its tools for keeping children safe.",
   "point": "",
   "picture": {
    "kind": "",
    "what": "",
    "source": "",
    "source_label": ""
   },
   "on_screen_text": "",
   "modules": [],
   "motion": "",
   "timing": "from the take (narration_diff.py)"
  },
  {
   "words": "Here's the clever bit.",
   "point": "",
   "picture": {
    "kind": "",
    "what": "",
    "source": "",
    "source_label": ""
   },
   "on_screen_text": "",
   "modules": [],
   "motion": "",
   "timing": "from the take (narration_diff.py)"
  },
  {
   "words": "Character.AI filed for bankruptcy on the twelfth of October.",
   "point": "",
   "picture": {
    "kind": "",
    "what": "",
    "source": "",
    "source_label": ""
   },
   "on_screen_text": "",
   "modules": [],
   "motion": "",
   "timing": "from the take (narration_diff.py)"
  },
  {
   "words": "And Disney made that a condition of its offer, and the papers even say why.",
   "point": "",
   "picture": {
    "kind": "",
    "what": "",
    "source": "",
    "source_label": ""
   },
   "on_screen_text": "",
   "modules": [],
   "motion": "",
   "timing": "from the take (narration_diff.py)"
  },
  {
   "words": "Character.AI was running low on cash.",
   "point": "",
   "picture": {
    "kind": "",
    "what": "",
    "source": "",
    "source_label": ""
   },
   "on_screen_text": "",
   "modules": [],
   "motion": "",
   "timing": "from the take (narration_diff.py)"
  },
  {
   "words": "And it faced lawsuits from families and US states, who say its chatbots harmed children.",
   "point": "",
   "picture": {
    "kind": "",
    "what": "",
    "source": "",
    "source_label": ""
   },
   "on_screen_text": "",
   "modules": [],
   "motion": "",
   "timing": "from the take (narration_diff.py)"
  },
  {
   "words": "Going through the court means Disney takes the people and the code, clean, while the lawsuits stay behind with Character.AI.",
   "point": "",
   "picture": {
    "kind": "",
    "what": "",
    "source": "",
    "source_label": ""
   },
   "on_screen_text": "",
   "modules": [],
   "motion": "",
   "timing": "from the take (narration_diff.py)"
  },
  {
   "words": "So who is left holding the empty box?",
   "point": "",
   "picture": {
    "kind": "",
    "what": "",
    "source": "",
    "source_label": ""
   },
   "on_screen_text": "",
   "modules": [],
   "motion": "",
   "timing": "from the take (narration_diff.py)"
  },
  {
   "words": "The people who used the app, for a start.",
   "point": "",
   "picture": {
    "kind": "",
    "what": "",
    "source": "",
    "source_label": ""
   },
   "on_screen_text": "",
   "modules": [],
   "motion": "",
   "timing": "from the take (narration_diff.py)"
  },
  {
   "words": "Disney didn't bid for the app itself, or for anyone's chats.",
   "point": "",
   "picture": {
    "kind": "",
    "what": "",
    "source": "",
    "source_label": ""
   },
   "on_screen_text": "",
   "modules": [],
   "motion": "",
   "timing": "from the take (narration_diff.py)"
  },
  {
   "words": "So what happens to the app is now up to the court.",
   "point": "",
   "picture": {
    "kind": "",
    "what": "",
    "source": "",
    "source_label": ""
   },
   "on_screen_text": "",
   "modules": [],
   "motion": "",
   "timing": "from the take (narration_diff.py)"
  },
  {
   "words": "And then there are the people suing Character.AI, whose claims stay with a firm that is being sold for parts.",
   "point": "",
   "picture": {
    "kind": "",
    "what": "",
    "source": "",
    "source_label": ""
   },
   "on_screen_text": "",
   "modules": [],
   "motion": "",
   "timing": "from the take (narration_diff.py)"
  },
  {
   "words": "See, the money followed the people.",
   "point": "",
   "picture": {
    "kind": "",
    "what": "",
    "source": "",
    "source_label": ""
   },
   "on_screen_text": "",
   "modules": [],
   "motion": "",
   "timing": "from the take (narration_diff.py)"
  },
  {
   "words": "Google paid billions for the tech and the founders, and Disney is paying millions for the rest of the team.",
   "point": "",
   "picture": {
    "kind": "",
    "what": "",
    "source": "",
    "source_label": ""
   },
   "on_screen_text": "",
   "modules": [],
   "motion": "",
   "timing": "from the take (narration_diff.py)"
  },
  {
   "words": "Everyone else is left with the empty box.",
   "point": "",
   "picture": {
    "kind": "",
    "what": "",
    "source": "",
    "source_label": ""
   },
   "on_screen_text": "",
   "modules": [],
   "motion": "",
   "timing": "from the take (narration_diff.py)"
  },
  {
   "words": "And it isn't just Disney.",
   "point": "",
   "picture": {
    "kind": "",
    "what": "",
    "source": "",
    "source_label": ""
   },
   "on_screen_text": "",
   "modules": [],
   "motion": "",
   "timing": "from the take (narration_diff.py)"
  },
  {
   "words": "Netflix bought an AI film start-up this year, and the record label Warner Music bought an AI firm too.",
   "point": "",
   "picture": {
    "kind": "",
    "what": "",
    "source": "",
    "source_label": ""
   },
   "on_screen_text": "",
   "modules": [],
   "motion": "",
   "timing": "from the take (narration_diff.py)"
  },
  {
   "words": "The big media firms have stopped renting AI, and started owning it.",
   "point": "",
   "picture": {
    "kind": "",
    "what": "",
    "source": "",
    "source_label": ""
   },
   "on_screen_text": "",
   "modules": [],
   "motion": "",
   "timing": "from the take (narration_diff.py)"
  },
  {
   "words": "So my prediction is that three more giants follow them.",
   "point": "",
   "picture": {
    "kind": "",
    "what": "",
    "source": "",
    "source_label": ""
   },
   "on_screen_text": "",
   "modules": [],
   "motion": "",
   "timing": "from the take (narration_diff.py)"
  },
  {
   "words": "First, Skydance, the new owner of Paramount Pictures.",
   "point": "",
   "picture": {
    "kind": "",
    "what": "",
    "source": "",
    "source_label": ""
   },
   "on_screen_text": "",
   "modules": [],
   "motion": "",
   "timing": "from the take (narration_diff.py)"
  },
  {
   "words": "Then the record label Universal Music.",
   "point": "",
   "picture": {
    "kind": "",
    "what": "",
    "source": "",
    "source_label": ""
   },
   "on_screen_text": "",
   "modules": [],
   "motion": "",
   "timing": "from the take (narration_diff.py)"
  },
  {
   "words": "And then Comcast, the American TV giant that owns NBC.",
   "point": "",
   "picture": {
    "kind": "",
    "what": "",
    "source": "",
    "source_label": ""
   },
   "on_screen_text": "",
   "modules": [],
   "motion": "",
   "timing": "from the take (narration_diff.py)"
  },
  {
   "words": "By the first of March, 2027, I reckon each of them will announce buying an AI firm or its team.",
   "point": "",
   "picture": {
    "kind": "",
    "what": "",
    "source": "",
    "source_label": ""
   },
   "on_screen_text": "",
   "modules": [],
   "motion": "",
   "timing": "from the take (narration_diff.py)"
  },
  {
   "words": "And I'm seventy-five percent sure all three will do it.",
   "point": "",
   "picture": {
    "kind": "",
    "what": "",
    "source": "",
    "source_label": ""
   },
   "on_screen_text": "",
   "modules": [],
   "motion": "",
   "timing": "from the take (narration_diff.py)"
  },
  {
   "words": "Now, why should you care if you're not Disney?",
   "point": "",
   "picture": {
    "kind": "",
    "what": "",
    "source": "",
    "source_label": ""
   },
   "on_screen_text": "",
   "modules": [],
   "motion": "",
   "timing": "from the take (narration_diff.py)"
  },
  {
   "words": "Because most businesses now run on someone else's AI.",
   "point": "",
   "picture": {
    "kind": "",
    "what": "",
    "source": "",
    "source_label": ""
   },
   "on_screen_text": "",
   "modules": [],
   "motion": "",
   "timing": "from the take (narration_diff.py)"
  },
  {
   "words": "It might be your writing tool, your chatbot, or maybe your whole customer service desk.",
   "point": "",
   "picture": {
    "kind": "",
    "what": "",
    "source": "",
    "source_label": ""
   },
   "on_screen_text": "",
   "modules": [],
   "motion": "",
   "timing": "from the take (narration_diff.py)"
  },
  {
   "words": "If that supplier goes the way of Sora, the tool can switch off.",
   "point": "",
   "picture": {
    "kind": "",
    "what": "",
    "source": "",
    "source_label": ""
   },
   "on_screen_text": "",
   "modules": [],
   "motion": "",
   "timing": "from the take (narration_diff.py)"
  },
  {
   "words": "And your work in it can go too.",
   "point": "",
   "picture": {
    "kind": "",
    "what": "",
    "source": "",
    "source_label": ""
   },
   "on_screen_text": "",
   "modules": [],
   "motion": "",
   "timing": "from the take (narration_diff.py)"
  },
  {
   "words": "And this story shows the warning signs, years before the end.",
   "point": "",
   "picture": {
    "kind": "",
    "what": "",
    "source": "",
    "source_label": ""
   },
   "on_screen_text": "",
   "modules": [],
   "motion": "",
   "timing": "from the take (narration_diff.py)"
  },
  {
   "words": "Here's what I'd do with this info if I were you.",
   "point": "",
   "picture": {
    "kind": "",
    "what": "",
    "source": "",
    "source_label": ""
   },
   "on_screen_text": "",
   "modules": [],
   "motion": "",
   "timing": "from the take (narration_diff.py)"
  },
  {
   "words": "Pick the AI tool your business leans on most, and ask four things about the firm that makes it.",
   "point": "",
   "picture": {
    "kind": "",
    "what": "",
    "source": "",
    "source_label": ""
   },
   "on_screen_text": "",
   "modules": [],
   "motion": "",
   "timing": "from the take (narration_diff.py)"
  },
  {
   "words": "First, are its founders still there?",
   "point": "",
   "picture": {
    "kind": "",
    "what": "",
    "source": "",
    "source_label": ""
   },
   "on_screen_text": "",
   "modules": [],
   "motion": "",
   "timing": "from the take (narration_diff.py)"
  },
  {
   "words": "Google took Character.AI's founders two years before the end.",
   "point": "",
   "picture": {
    "kind": "",
    "what": "",
    "source": "",
    "source_label": ""
   },
   "on_screen_text": "",
   "modules": [],
   "motion": "",
   "timing": "from the take (narration_diff.py)"
  },
  {
   "words": "Second, is your tool the main thing that firm sells, or a side bet?",
   "point": "",
   "picture": {
    "kind": "",
    "what": "",
    "source": "",
    "source_label": ""
   },
   "on_screen_text": "",
   "modules": [],
   "motion": "",
   "timing": "from the take (narration_diff.py)"
  },
  {
   "words": "Sora was a side bet, and it vanished.",
