   "picture": {
    "kind": "",
    "what": "",
    "source": "",
    "source_label": ""
   },
   "on_screen_text": "",
   "modules": [],
   "motion": "",
   "timing": "from the take (narration_diff.py)"
  },
  {
   "words": "Third, is the firm running short of cash?",
   "point": "",
   "picture": {
    "kind": "",
    "what": "",
    "source": "",
    "source_label": ""
   },
   "on_screen_text": "",
   "modules": [],
   "motion": "",
   "timing": "from the take (narration_diff.py)"
  },
  {
   "words": "The court papers warned about exactly that.",
   "point": "",
   "picture": {
    "kind": "",
    "what": "",
    "source": "",
    "source_label": ""
   },
   "on_screen_text": "",
   "modules": [],
   "motion": "",
   "timing": "from the take (narration_diff.py)"
  },
  {
   "words": "And fourth, is it collecting lawsuits?",
   "point": "",
   "picture": {
    "kind": "",
    "what": "",
    "source": "",
    "source_label": ""
   },
   "on_screen_text": "",
   "modules": [],
   "motion": "",
   "timing": "from the take (narration_diff.py)"
  },
  {
   "words": "That's why Disney went through the court.",
   "point": "",
   "picture": {
